OL,3,GNEWSAMSPs 'unable to say' if Scottish
OL,4,Agovernment spending plans are
OL,5,Aaffordable
OL,6,
OL,7,FA Holyrood committee says it has been
OL,8,Funable to determine whether the
OL,9,FScottish government's tax and spending
OL,10,Fplans are affordable due to a lack of
OL,11,Ftransparency from ministers.
OL,13,FMSPs on the Finance and Public
OL,14,FAdministration Committee said in a
OL,15,Freport that the government must provide
OL,16,F"much greater transparency" on its
OL,17,Fprogress in closing a forecasted #5bn
OL,18,Fgap in the nation's finances.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,422,420,260,160,0,100
