OL,2,W//%*// //%Q,.*,%-. * *,$%** %-& (,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAMSPs 'unable to say' if Scottish
OL,4,Agovernment spending plans are
OL,5,Aaffordable
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe committee warned of "substantial
OL,8,Frisks" to next year's Budget if
OL,9,Fministers fail to deliver on plans to
OL,10,Freform public services, boost economic
OL,11,Fgrowth and increase the tax take.
OL,13,FThe Scottish government said it would
OL,14,Fconsider the recommendations of the
OL,15,Freport, adding it had delivered a
OL,16,Fbalanced budget every year.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
